-emit-lifecycle-events-completion-and-merge.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/72-go-structural-cleanup/phase-02-typed-status-enums.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/102-config-cleanup/phase-01-remove-recovery.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/87-go-codebase-simplification/phase-07-loop-event-helpers.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/47-delete-go-tui/phase-04-delete-bubbletea-tui-skill.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/26-context-usage-tracking/phase-01-extend-canonical-events-with-context-metrics.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/26-context-usage-tracking/phase-05-add-context-efficiency-to-quality-skill.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/26-context-usage-tracking/phase-03-add-skill-attribution-to-canonical-events.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/26-context-usage-tracking/phase-06-add-context-audit-to-meditate-skill.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/74-vestigial-queue-cleanup/phase-03-update-docs-skills-and-brain.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/21-fixture-directory-redesign/phase-05-event-monitor-spawner-migration.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/20-onboarding/phase-04-concept-skills.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/81-stage-groups/phase-06-skill.md\n/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/noodle78-delivery-20260916/control/brain/archive/plans/49-work-orders-redesign/phase-07-schedule-handling-and-skill-contract.